POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/episodes/{{EpisodeId}}/translations
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languageCode": "en",
  "title": "Secrets and Losses",
  "overview": "A young boy mysteriously disappears in the forest."
}

### 🟢 8.11 Bölümden Çeviri Kaldırma (Admin)
